# Add patterns of files dvc should ignore, which could improve
# the performance. Learn more at
# https://dvc.org/doc/user-guide/dvcignore

# wmake build artifacts living inside the model source tree.
#
# build-turbulence-lib takes sim/newModel/src as an input and writes these
# directories as a side effect of compiling, so without this the stage
# invalidates itself: every run changes the hash of its own dependency. The
# directory names are also platform-specific (darwin64Clang.. vs
# linuxARM64Gcc..), so the dependency hash differs between machines and the
# stage shows as stale on any machine that did not build it.
/sim/newModel/src/lnInclude/
/sim/newModel/solver/lnInclude/
/sim/newModel/src/Make/*/
/sim/newModel/solver/Make/*/
*.pyc
